{"id":"f32c7d95792dcee2","group":"91","path":"91/91-thm-CT-conservative.md","title":"算术归纳 CT减对 PA 的保守性","display":"thm-CT-conservative — 算术归纳 CT减对 PA 的保守性","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth","book_abbrev":"91","label":"91-thm-CT-conservative","aliases":["91-thm-CT-conservative","91-thm-CT-conservative-extension","91-thm-compositional-conservative"],"display":"thm-CT-conservative — 算术归纳 CT减对 PA 的保守性","depends_on":["[[91-df-compositional-truth]]","[[91-df-conservative-truth]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"91"},{"key":"label","html":"91-thm-CT-conservative"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>91-thm-CT-conservative</span><span>91-thm-CT-conservative-extension</span><span>91-thm-compositional-conservative</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-CT-conservative — 算术归纳 CT减对 PA 的保守性"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"66b3ab8406681395\" href=\"?note=66b3ab8406681395\" title=\"91-df-compositional-truth\">91-df-compositional-truth</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"4a1d989a5f615933\" href=\"?note=4a1d989a5f615933\" title=\"91-df-conservative-truth\">91-df-conservative-truth</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PA}\">\\(\\mathrm{PA}\\)</span> 为固定基础算术。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CT}^{-}\">\\(\\mathrm{CT}^{-}\\)</span> 是原书 CT<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\upharpoonright\">\\(\\upharpoonright\\)</span>，仅含基础算术归纳；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_0}\">\\(\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_0}\\)</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}CT\\text{-}conservative}\\vdash\\quad\n\\mathrm{CT}^{-}\\vdash\\varphi\\quad\\Longrightarrow\\quad\\mathrm{PA}\\vdash\\varphi.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}CT\\text{-}conservative}\\vdash\\quad\n\\mathrm{CT}^{-}\\vdash\\varphi\\quad\\Longrightarrow\\quad\\mathrm{PA}\\vdash\\varphi.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>这是 Theorem 8.5，而非由去引号实例直接推出的结论。提供的 PDF 是修订版：原书明确撤回第一版错误的消去证明，说明可用 Enayat–Visser 的模型论路线（向适当初等扩张加入满足类），并指出 Leigh 的另一证明论路线。此处保留完整定理，但不把该错误的旧证明改述成已经验证的切消证明。\n模型保守性要求原模型本身直接扩张，强于此算术保守性；不是每个 PA 模型都有满足类。含全部 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ind}_T\">\\(\\mathrm{Ind}_T\\)</span> 的 CT 则证明 PA 一致性，不能在定理中替换 CT<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"^-\">\\(^-\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>来源：Theorem 8.5 及修订版说明，印刷页 68–69，PDF 页 79–80；Definition 8.6。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"91-df-compositional-truth","status":"resolved","id":"66b3ab8406681395","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-compositional-truth]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-conservative-truth","status":"resolved","id":"4a1d989a5f615933","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-conservative-truth]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{PA}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CT}^{-}","display":false},{"tex":"\\upharpoonright","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_0}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}CT\\text{-}conservative}\\vdash\\quad\n\\mathrm{CT}^{-}\\vdash\\varphi\\quad\\Longrightarrow\\quad\\mathrm{PA}\\vdash\\varphi.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Ind}_T","display":false},{